Package: streamradio
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: internet radio player for V\OS
 StreamRadio is an internet radio player with a station list: add
 stations or playlist URLs, probe them for stream details, play them
 and follow ICY metadata (now playing titles) while they stream.
